# Long Night across the scenes (ZEN-1's Natural, carried over): one night that passes from scene to scene. A scene's
# mood 0 is the door; the night holds a scene for one round of its own long form (30 minutes) and passes to the next
# of its table (ui.c AMB_NIGHT: Crypt, Night Sky, Forest Ruins, Frozen Lake) through dark, the old scene's notes
# ringing out under the new one's. A whole round is proved here in simulated time: two hours and a little.
# The simulator's list: 0 Sakura, 1 Koi, 2 Hotaru, 3 Crypt, 4 Forest Ruins, 5 Frozen Lake, 6 Night Sky.
wait 800
wavgain 24
expect scene 0
# Sakura is none of the night's: its Natural is its own
expect night 0
# the door: Crypt, its mood Long Night (three clicks from Sakura)
spin PRESET 1
wait 150
spin PRESET 1
wait 150
spin PRESET 1
wait 1500
expect scene 3
expect showing 3
expect knob0 0
expect night 1
expect guest 0
expect passes 0
# a door starts early in Crypt's round, never in a round's last tenth
expect longat <901
# the sleep timer set: 4 h, to run across every pass
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
expect sleep 5
# the knobs' page left on Volume, and a save, so that a pass can be seen to save nothing
tap FX
tap FX
expect page 1
tap SAVE
wait 4000
expect dirty 0
# another mood is not the night; back to Long Night it is again; Drift at Off (the Key page, KNOB 4) holds the night
# in its scene, Slow lets it go on
spin ALGO 1
expect knob0 1
expect night 0
wait 400
spin ALGO -1
expect knob0 0
expect night 1
wait 3500
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect page 4
spin K4 -1
expect night 0
spin K4 1
expect night 1
wait 3500
tap FX
tap FX
expect page 1
tap SAVE
wait 4000
expect dirty 0
# the first pass comes when Crypt's round ends: within half an hour. Before it, nothing has moved
wait 60000
expect passes 0
expect fade 256
wait 1800000
expect passes 1
# Night Sky, a guest, at its round's beginning (Dusk): the project's scene is still the door, nothing is to be saved,
# the sleep timer and the page are as they were, the picture is whole again
expect showing 6
expect scene 3
expect guest 1
expect night 2
expect knob0 0
expect fade 256
expect sleep 5
expect asleep 0
expect page 1
expect dirty 0
expect longat <950
expect nsstars >0
expect textfit 0
shot night-sky.png
# its round is half an hour: 25 minutes on it is still here, 6 more and the night is in Forest Ruins
wait 1500000
expect passes 1
wait 360000
expect passes 2
expect showing 4
expect scene 3
expect guest 1
expect night 3
expect textfit 0
shot night-ruins.png
# a knob turned in a guest is its own Long Night's tweak (Forest Ruins' slot), and the scene still a guest
spin SELECT 3
expect tweaks 1
expect guest 1
expect scene 3
# on to Frozen Lake
wait 1800000
expect passes 3
expect showing 5
expect guest 1
expect night 4
expect textfit 0
shot night-lake.png
# and round to the door: Crypt again, no guest there. A whole round of the night: two hours
wait 1800000
expect passes 4
expect showing 3
expect scene 3
expect guest 0
expect night 1
expect sleep 5
expect asleep 0
# the handover itself, watched: Crypt's round's last seconds. The picture goes down over 4 s, the scenes change in the
# dark, the next comes up over 4 s; notes of the old scene ring on under the new one's first drone breath, and the
# output is never silent across it (the peak since 3 s before the dark)
nightleft 15000
expect passes 4
expect fade 256
# (a picture either side of it and a render across it, 15 s before to 8 s after: night.wav)
shot night-before.png
wav night.wav
nightleft 2000
expect passes 4
expect fade <250
peakreset
wait 2900
expect passes 5
expect showing 6
expect fade <200
expect passed >0
expect drones >0
expect nvoices >1
expect peak_db_min -70
wait 5000
expect fade 256
wavstop
shot night-after.png
expect stale 0
expect race 0
# the Mood turned in a guest: the scene is the player's now (the next power-on's), and another mood ends the night
spin ALGO 1
expect knob0 1
expect guest 0
expect scene 6
expect night 0
wait 4000
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 800
expect scene 6
expect knob0 1
expect night 0
# back to Long Night: the night goes on from here
spin ALGO -1
expect knob0 0
expect night 2
# PRESETS during the night is the player's choice as ever: Crypt, three scenes back
spin PRESET -1
wait 150
spin PRESET -1
wait 150
spin PRESET -1
wait 1500
expect scene 3
expect showing 3
expect guest 0
expect night 1
# the Mood turned away during the fade to dark stops the pass: the picture comes back and the scene stays
nightleft 2000
expect fade <250
spin ALGO 1
expect night 0
wait 5000
expect fade 256
expect passes 5
expect showing 3
